      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Work done in moving a body along a complete circular path is ALWAYS zero because the displacement is zero.",
        "Unit Conversions Frequently Asked: 1 Joule = 10^7 Ergs, and 1 Horsepower (HP) = 746 Watts.",
        "When a coolie carries luggage on his head while walking on a flat horizontal platform, work done against gravity is ZERO (θ = 90°)."
